       11      Normal compilation.

       22      Debugging mode.  The generated opcodes are dumped in hexadecimal
              into the kernel log.  These opcodes can then be disassembled us‐
              ing  the program _t_o_o_l_s_/_n_e_t_/_b_p_f___j_i_t___d_i_s_a_s_m_._c provided in the ker‐
              nel source tree.

